OL,3,GNEWSARail services disrupted by
OL,4,Aelectricity fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services between Eastleigh and
OL,7,FFareham are being disrupted due to
OL,8,Felectrical supply problems.
OL,10,FThe fault means there are no services
OL,11,Frunning via Botley on South Western
OL,12,FRailway (SWR), with trains diverting to
OL,13,FSt Denys.
OL,15,FSWR said replacement buses would run
OL,16,Fbetween Fareham and Eastleigh, via
OL,17,FBotley and Hedge End, but not to a
OL,18,Fscheduled timetable.
OL,20,FTravellers are urged to check their
OL,21,Fjourney with disruption expected until
OL,22,Fabout midday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
